        ["NativeFrames.ModernConsent"] = "Enable adapters for Explorer, Paint and Notepad?\n\nVeliShell may load its native DLL into the identified Microsoft app windows, including the Explorer process. Only approved windows are subclassed; no global hooks or system file changes. Tabs and search remain available; app-drawn title bars get additional space inside the window.\n\nExperimental: test in a VM first and save your work. In Explorer, the inactive DLL remains loaded after rollback until process exit or sign-out. No other process is terminated automatically. Previous appearance-only consent does not authorize this.\n\nExceptions, independent recovery, Ctrl + Alt + Shift + F12 and WINDOW-RECOVERY.cmd remain available. Hung apps must respond before recovery can finish. Continue?",
